4,Southern Yukaghir language and alphabet - Omniglot,https://www.omniglot.com/writing/southernyukaghir.htm,"Southern Yukaghir (Одул) Southern Yukaghir is a Yukaghir language spoken in the Far East region of the Russian Federation, particularly in the towns of Nelemnoje and Zyrjanka in Republic of Sakha (Yakutia), and in Srednekolymsk, Sejmtjan and Balygytjan in Kolyma county of the Magadan Oblast.","Yukaghir, Southern",Yukaghir
